# Line endings
#
# Everything is LF, both in the repository and in the working tree, on every platform.
#
# This is not cosmetic. The campaign image is built on Linux and `COPY` in
# containers/Dockerfile takes files exactly as they are on disk. A CRLF line ending in a shell
# script or a config file read by a Linux tool fails with an error that points nowhere near its
# cause. Pinning LF here removes the class of problem instead of the symptom, and it silences the
# "LF will be replaced by CRLF" warnings on Windows checkouts as a side effect.

* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary files must never be converted or diffed as text.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.pdf binary
*.sif binary
*.ji  binary
